  "ingredients": [
    "1 stick butter",
    "1.5 cups packed brown sugar",
    "1 (20 ounce) can sliced pineapple",
    "1 (4 ounce) jar cherries",
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2.5 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1 cup milk",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sgAtyPvTrJP5mEepzySqWWm-Mkg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273774-grandmas-skillet-pineapple-upside-down-cake-dmfs-step-1-0edf42322d4a4e8aaeaef189f2e4b128.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273774/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 1 stick of butter in the bottom of a 12-inch cast iron skillet over medium heat, about 3 minutes. Remove from heat and sprinkle brown sugar evenly over butter. Add pineapple slices to the skillet in a decorative layer with a cherry in the middle of each pineapple ring. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JuC-DGeLaeAUkVZP_6WHoX3qNrg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273774-grandmas-skillet-pineapple-upside-down-cake-dmfs-step-2-5d97a07f1afb4b73b0f115307484e077.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273774/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, baking powder, and salt together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/23wSjFjVEy_Py9LRjcB_jo262AE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273774-grandmas-skillet-pineapple-upside-down-cake-dmfs-step-3-3a97f9a84dfe4a5ba277288fdc7b1ac3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273774/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cream sugar and remaining 1 stick of butter together in a bowl. Add eggs and mix.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yJzP_RApHMm7NFFMMLP9UgzQU1U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273774-grandmas-skillet-pineapple-upside-down-cake-dmfs-step-4-ce98ef3fe01047a3bbe2612cd1631ed1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273774/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add flour mixture and milk in an alternating fashion. Add vanilla extract and mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SOVDHWWfNT9J-WNeLgxjwBowAYw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273774-grandmas-skillet-pineapple-upside-down-cake-dmfs-step-5-c1e4e803ec4d44449a1e7ddb7a8705e4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273774/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture evenly over pineapples in the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OKKoMCYBW3gmMeyUCThLsnm3Flg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273774-grandmas-skillet-pineapple-upside-down-cake-dmfs-step-6-e8483be00b4e4d1983455bc01fb22538.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273774/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cake is golden brown, about 40 minutes. Let cake cool in the skillet for 10 minutes before inverting onto a serving plate. Serve warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bQWHjPZ_M5VTMXwTMK_3Y_UaWng=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273774-grandmas-skillet-pineapple-upside-down-cake-dmfs-step-7-2904a8783a0e47bd8569b3cb4a05e2b5.jpg"
      ],
